   // ==== associations, within this project ================================================================
   // The AssociationMapping(...) wrapper is mandatory: without it the grammar reads the block
   // as a CLASS mapping and reports "Can't find class client_reporting::CrpRunStatements",
   // which names the wrong problem. Both ends use the SAME join; the engine reverses it for
   // the end that walks against the declared direction.

   client_reporting::CrpRunStatements: Relational
   {
      AssociationMapping
      (
         run[crpStatement, crpStatementRun]: [client_reporting::Store]@Crp_StatementRun,
         statements[crpStatementRun, crpStatement]: [client_reporting::Store]@Crp_StatementRun
      )
   }

